== Short Bio
I am an Assistant Professor of [https://cs.shanghai.nyu.edu/ Computer Science at NYU Shanghai], where I lead the [https://heavyball-research.github.io/ HeavyBall Research] group.
I am also affiliated with the [https://engineering.nyu.edu/ Tandon School of Engineering] at New York University.

Previously, I was a Research Engineer at [https://www.together.ai/ Together AI], contributing to the development of inference engines and GPU kernels for large language and vision-language model serving. 
Before that, I earned my Ph.D. in [https://www.cs.cornell.edu/ Computer Science from Cornell University], advised by [https://www.cs.cornell.edu/~cdesa/ Chris De Sa].

My research interests lie broadly in efficient modeling, hardware-aware training and inference algorithms, and the systems that bring them together at scale.

